.env.*
!.env.example

/apps/mobile/
/apps/studio/
/apps/ai-api/
/api/
/docs/
/rive-intro/
/scripts/
/supabase/
/tests/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/

*.pptx
*.docx
*.zip
*.tsbuildinfo
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
.venv-workers/
